@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Proposed — Visitor resolves an exact eligible publication
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Visitor
participant "Representation / Sharing" as S
participant "Current authority / eligibility" as A
participant "Presentation" as P
participant "Evaluated renderer / representation resolver" as R
participant "Files" as F
Visitor -> S : exact page/link/language request
S -> A : current resource / viewer / link eligibility
alt eligible
 S -> P : resolve permitted exact publication identity + manifest
 P --> S : immutable intended manifest or unavailable
 S -> R : exact manifest + selected layout/language/output contract
 opt actual selected representation requires protected bytes
  R -> F : guarded exact usable artifact resolution
  F --> R : actual usable identity or safe unavailable
 end
 R --> S : permitted output or actual failure/unavailable
 S --> Visitor : exact eligible result; no private fallback
else denied / revoked / unavailable
 S --> Visitor : safe bounded response
end
note over S,F
 Cache/CDN is not selected. Any future cache must preserve exact identity,
 current eligibility, invalidation and private serving boundaries.
end note

@enduml
